Content-Type: application/json

{"index": "ecommerce_products_spus", "name": "iphone"}

### k8s网关
POST http://{{k8s_gateway_host}}:{{k8s_gateway_port}}/search/search.v1.SearchService/Search
Content-Type: application/json

{"index": "ecommerce_products_spus", "name": "iphone"}

### SubmitApplication
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/SubmitApplication
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company_name": "示例科技有限公司",
  "credit_code": "91110108MA01XXXXXX",
  "legal_person": "张三",
  "legal_person_id": "11010119900307663X",
  "contact_phone": "13812345678",
  "business_license_url": "https://example.com/images/license.jpg",
  "legal_person_id_front_url": "https://example.com/images/id_front.jpg",
  "legal_person_id_back_url": "https://example.com/images/id_back.jpg",
  "category_ids": [1001, 1002, 1003],
  "remark": "加急处理"
}

### GetApplication
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/GetApplication
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationId": "019e7819-634d-791f-b823-c2374003d3a3"
}

### ApproveApplication
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/ApproveApplication
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer ***REMOVED-JWT***

{
  "applicationId": "019e7819-634d-791f-b823-c2374003d3a3",
  "auditComment": "Approve"
}

### Gateway ApproveApplication
POST http://{{gateway_host}}:{{gateway_port}}/merchant/merchant.v1.MerchantService/ApproveApplication
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer ***REMOVED-JWT***

{
  "applicationId": "019e7819-634d-791f-b823-c2374003d3a3",
  "auditComment": "Approve"
}
